    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/d4ba8be12ca88c54a4dc7b5a1d4e4fda.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blightspire</strong> is a fast-paced, wave-based survival shooter. Battle through a cursed graveyard as undead abominations rise in endless waves. With only your reflexes and firepower, survive the darkness in a world where death is never the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a plague-stricken 17th-century, you\u2019re a thief drawn to rumors of treasure buried in a cursed cemetery. As you rob the graves, the dead rise to defend what\u2019s theirs. Fighting to survive, you uncover a demonic presence seeping from an ancient church altar, its influence twisting the dead and spreading corruption. Now, it\u2019s not just about gold... it\u2019s about stopping hell from breaking loose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/c5d58d8d1954eb33e7beaea6d4fbd596.poster.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/c5d58d8d1954eb33e7beaea6d4fbd596.webm?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/c5d58d8d1954eb33e7beaea6d4fbd596.mp4?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless waves of the undead as the Black Death twists the once-living into monstrous horrors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, dash, and leap through plague-ridden graveyards to avoid the infected swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty revolver to blast through the twisted remains of humanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive, and uncover the dark forces fueling the nightmare</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/986ed1d7007fdc4f85718b776aab2a2e.poster.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/986ed1d7007fdc4f85718b776aab2a2e.webm?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/986ed1d7007fdc4f85718b776aab2a2e.mp4?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the stranger it gets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the fallen dead to fund powerful relics from a demonic source</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb their lingering souls to restore your health and keep fighting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/59b59bb36f8791853c198a9d1f3cf932.poster.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/59b59bb36f8791853c198a9d1f3cf932.webm?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/59b59bb36f8791853c198a9d1f3cf932.mp4?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the demonic presence in the graveyard and use the unholy relics to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/d4ba8be12ca88c54a4dc7b5a1d4e4fda.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blightspire</strong> is a fast-paced, wave-based survival shooter. Battle through a cursed graveyard as undead abominations rise in endless waves. With only your reflexes and firepower, survive the darkness in a world where death is never the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a plague-stricken 17th-century, you\u2019re a thief drawn to rumors of treasure buried in a cursed cemetery. As you rob the graves, the dead rise to defend what\u2019s theirs. Fighting to survive, you uncover a demonic presence seeping from an ancient church altar, its influence twisting the dead and spreading corruption. Now, it\u2019s not just about gold... it\u2019s about stopping hell from breaking loose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/c5d58d8d1954eb33e7beaea6d4fbd596.poster.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/c5d58d8d1954eb33e7beaea6d4fbd596.webm?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/c5d58d8d1954eb33e7beaea6d4fbd596.mp4?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless waves of the undead as the Black Death twists the once-living into monstrous horrors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, dash, and leap through plague-ridden graveyards to avoid the infected swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty revolver to blast through the twisted remains of humanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive, and uncover the dark forces fueling the nightmare</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/986ed1d7007fdc4f85718b776aab2a2e.poster.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/986ed1d7007fdc4f85718b776aab2a2e.webm?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/986ed1d7007fdc4f85718b776aab2a2e.mp4?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the stranger it gets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the fallen dead to fund powerful relics from a demonic source</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb their lingering souls to restore your health and keep fighting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/59b59bb36f8791853c198a9d1f3cf932.poster.avif?t=1750147177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/59b59bb36f8791853c198a9d1f3cf932.webm?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365920/extras/59b59bb36f8791853c198a9d1f3cf932.mp4?t=1750147177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the demonic presence in the graveyard and use the unholy relics to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
